{"script":"yd_005_06-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"y":-297,"trans":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1b","timeBak":300,"nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"layer":"chara2","x":280,"transTime":0,"y":-297,"trans":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]都怪艾尔莎那家伙，让所有人都觉得我力气很大。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]其实我只是因为血脉带来的体质，让我感觉不到轻度损伤的痛苦。一点点韧带拉伤或者脱臼之类的，不痛不痒，而且很快就能恢复。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]所以我比起大部分种族，可以将力量用到一百二十分，稍微超过身体机能罢了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]不用担心我，就像我说的，不痛不痒，也没有副作用。就连这双受伤严重的腿，再过个几年也能重新长出来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-怪力女仆"}